== B. The max-halving skeleton and the flip calculus (Lemmas C, MH, F of the note) ==
  [ok] B1. rho_max(max-halving) = 1/2 for q = 5, 7, 9, 11 at k = 8, 12, 16 (12 cases), and every witness is a cycle of the v=2 set S_inf (all accelerated valuations equal 2), as Lemma MH states
